      ":question/problem": "The curve has equation $x^{2} + 4 y^{2}=68$. The **tangent** line at $\\left(2,-4\\right)$ meets the $y$-axis at $P$. Find the coordinates of $P$.\n\nUse $y-y_0=m(x-x_0)$ with the given point. On the $y$-axis, $x=0$.",
