      ":question/problem": "The curve has equation $3 x^{2} + 3 y^{2}=30$. The **tangent** line at $\\left(-3,1\\right)$ meets the $x$-axis at $P$. Find the coordinates of $P$.\n\nUse $y-y_0=m(x-x_0)$ with the given point. On the $x$-axis, $y=0$.",
